stream
BT /F2 22 Tf 40 540 Td (Banana bread) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 40 518 Td (One loaf, about 10 slices. 15 minutes to mix, an hour in the oven.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 40 488 Td (Ingredients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 470 Td (3 very ripe bananas, mashed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 455 Td (75 g butter, melted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 440 Td (150 g light brown sugar) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 425 Td (1 egg, beaten) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 410 Td (1 tsp vanilla extract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 395 Td (1 tsp baking soda and a pinch of salt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 380 Td (190 g plain flour) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 365 Td (A handful of walnuts or dark chocolate, if you like) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 40 340 Td (Method) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 322 Td (1. Heat the oven to 175 °C and line a loaf tin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 307 Td (2. Stir the butter into the bananas, then the sugar, egg and vanilla.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 292 Td (3. Sprinkle over the soda and salt, then fold in the flour.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 277 Td (4. Bake for 55 to 65 minutes, until a skewer comes out clean.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 40 262 Td (5. Let it cool in the tin for 10 minutes before turning it out.) Tj ET
endstream
